@startuml

state NotStarted {}
state Assigned {}
state Approved {}
state PreparingAdverts {}
state ScheduledAdverts {}
state RunningAdverts {}
state AdjustingCampaign {}
state Completed {}
state Paid {}
state Archived {}

[*] --> NotStarted : Initial State

NotStarted --> Assigned : Manager and Staff Assigned
Assigned --> Approved : Everything Approved, Contract Signed
Approved --> PreparingAdverts : Adverts Prepared
PreparingAdverts --> ScheduledAdverts : Adverts Scheduled
ScheduledAdverts --> RunningAdverts : Adverts Running
RunningAdverts --> AdjustingCampaign : Extension or Adjustment Requested
RunningAdverts --> Completed : All Adverts Finished
Completed --> Paid : Full Amount Paid
Paid --> Archived : Campaign Marked as Paid

Completed --> [*] : Final State

@enduml
